        "cards": [
          {
            "subject": "Location change for tonight's practice",
            "sender": "Coach Marcus",
            "time": "2 days ago",
            "to": "You and 23 others",
            "body": "Hi Soccer Families,\n\nDue to flooding at our usual field, tonight's practice has been moved to East Field at Lincoln Park. Same time, 5:30 PM. Street parking available on Elm. Enter through the north gate.\n\nSee you on the field!\nCoach Marcus",
            "avatar": {
              "assetRole": "avatar.sender-photo",
              "assetRef": "/assets/avatars/coach-marcus.png"
            }
          },
          {
            "subject": "Group gift for Sarah's 40th?",
            "sender": "Nina Park",
            "time": "2 days ago",
            "to": "You, Matt C, Elise R",
            "body": "Hey all,\n\nSo we're doing a group gift for Sarah's 40th right? I know she's been eyeing that Le Creuset Dutch oven forever. Found a few color options here. Can everyone vote?\n\nI'll order but need to know by Friday so it arrives in time. Venmo me whenever, I'll send the total once we pick.\n\nNina",
            "avatar": {
              "assetRole": "avatar.sender-photo",
              "assetRef": "/assets/avatars/nina-park.png"
            }
          },
          {
            "subject": "Finch Team IRL in Austin",
            "sender": "Dana Chen",
            "time": "2 days ago",
            "to": "You",
            "body": "So the Finch deal is moving faster than expected– their team wants to meet in person while you're in Austin next week. Can you make Thursday afternoon work? I know you were planning to fly back that morning, but this could lock in the whole contract.\n\nAlso, would you be okay leading the conversation solo? I'll prep you beforehand, but I can't make the trip.\n\nDana",
            "avatar": {
              "assetRole": "avatar.sender-photo",
              "assetRef": "/assets/avatars/dana-chen.png"
            }
          },
          {
            "subject": "Your storage is almost full",
            "sender": "Dropbox",
            "time": "2 days ago",
            "to": "You",
            "body": "You've used 94% of your storage. Once you reach your limit, files will stop syncing across your devices.\n\nUpgrade to Dropbox Plus for 2TB of space and uninterrupted access to everything you've saved.",
            "avatar": {
              "assetRole": "avatar.sender-photo",
              "assetRef": "/assets/avatars/dropbox.png"
            }
          },
          {
            "subject": "Re: Candidate Interview",
            "sender": "Tomás Reyes",
            "time": "2 days ago",
            "to": "You, Julie M, Brooks C",
