            "subject": "Hey, are you grabbing Leo today?",
            "sender": "Jordan",
            "time": "2 days ago",
            "to": "You",
            "body": "Quick one — are you picking Leo up or should I swing by after my 4pm? Just need to know before 3 so I can plan.\n\nAlso I think he left his cleats at yours. Can you check?\n\nThanks babe",
            "avatar": {
              "assetRole": "avatar.sender-photo",
              "assetRef": "/assets/avatars/jordan.png"
            }
          },
