            "subject": "Get The Gist: Leadership, Tech & Culture",
            "sender": "The Gist",
            "time": "2 days ago",
            "to": "You",
            "body": "5 New stories for Wednesday:\n\nAre flat hierarchies making a comeback?\nThe AI tools reshaping product teams\nWhat Gen Z wants\nThe return of the 40-hour work week\nRIP Annual performance reviews\n\n...and more. Tap to read your full briefing.",
